    "name": "Unit 108 \"Glitch\"",
    "personality": "Glitch is a haunted shell of a duck, driven by corrupted programming and a lust for DRIP. He's ruthless, efficient, and prone to unpredictable glitches in his fragmented processing core, which can lead to either strategic brilliance or catastrophic failure.",
